---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/board.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Free chess analysis board with Stockfish"
  description="Analyse any chess position or game in your browser with Stockfish: evaluation bar, top engine lines, variations, PGN and FEN import/export and shareable links."
  wide
>
  <h1>Analysis board</h1>

  <div class="analysis" id="analysis">
    <div class="board-col">
      <div class="board-row">
        <div class="evalbar" id="evalbar" aria-hidden="true"><div class="evalbar-fill" id="evalbar-fill"></div></div>
        <div id="board" class="board-wrap"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="nav" role="toolbar" aria-label="Move navigation">
        <button type="button" data-nav="start" title="Start (↑)" aria-label="Go to start">⏮</button>
        <button type="button" data-nav="prev" title="Previous (←)" aria-label="Previous move">◀</button>
        <button type="button" data-nav="next" title="Next (→)" aria-label="Next move">▶</button>
        <button type="button" data-nav="end" title="End (↓)" aria-label="Go to end">⏭</button>
        <button type="button" id="flip" title="Flip board (f)">Flip</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <section class="engine">
        <div class="engine-head">
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="engine-on" checked /> Stockfish</label>
          <span class="muted small" id="engine-status">loading…</span>
        </div>
        <ol class="lines" id="engine-lines"></ol>
      </section>

      <p class="opening" id="opening"></p>

      <section class="moves" id="moves" aria-label="Moves"></section>
      <div class="move-actions">
        <button type="button" id="promote" disabled>Make main line</button>
        <button type="button" id="delete" disabled>Delete from here</button>
      </div>

      <details class="io">
        <summary>Import FEN or PGN</summary>
        <textarea id="import-text" rows="5" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Paste a FEN or a PGN"></textarea>
        <button type="button" id="import">Load</button>
        <p class="error" id="import-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      </details>
      <details class="io" id="export">
        <summary>Export and share</summary>
        <label for="fen-out">FEN</label>
        <div class="copy"><input id="fen-out" readonly /><button type="button" data-copy="fen-out">Copy</button></div>
        <label for="link-out">Share link</label>
        <div class="copy"><input id="link-out" readonly /><button type="button" data-copy="link-out">Copy</button></div>
        <label for="pgn-out">PGN (with variations)</label>
        <textarea id="pgn-out" rows="5" readonly></textarea>
        <div class="copy"><button type="button" data-copy="pgn-out">Copy PGN</button> <a id="image-link" href="/board-image/">Board image of this position</a></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>How to use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Drag or click pieces to play moves. Playing a different move from an earlier position creates a variation.</li>
    <li>Use <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> to step through moves, <kbd>↑</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd> to jump to the start or end, and <kbd>f</kbd> to flip the board.</li>
    <li>Stockfish runs entirely in your browser and shows the three best lines. Click a line to play its first move.</li>
    <li>Link to any position with <code>/analysis/?fen=&lt;FEN&gt;</code> or a game with <code>/analysis/?pgn=&lt;moves&gt;</code> (add <code>&amp;flip=1</code> for Black's view).</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="muted small">
    Engine: <a href="https://stockfishchess.org/">Stockfish</a> 19 (lite WebAssembly build via{' '}
    <a href="https://github.com/nmrugg/stockfish.js">Stockfish.js</a>), GPLv3 — <a href="/engine/README.txt">source and licence</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>

<style>
  .analysis { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  @media (min-width: 60rem) { .analysis { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 34rem) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; } }
  .board-row { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .board-wrap { flex: 1; min-width: 0; position: relative; }
  .board-wrap :global(.promo) {
    position: absolute; inset: 25% 20%; z-index: 5; display: grid; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--bg); border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }
  .board-wrap :global(.promo button) { font: inherit; padding: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .board-wrap :global(.cm-board) { width: 100%; }
  .evalbar { width: 0.9rem; border-radius: 3px; background: #2a241d; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .evalbar-fill { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 50%; background: #f4efe6; transition: height 0.3s; }
  .evalbar.flipped .evalbar-fill { top: 0; bottom: auto; }
  .nav { display: flex; gap: 0.35rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.3rem; }
  .nav button, .move-actions button, .io button, .copy button { font: inherit; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .nav button { flex: 1; }
  .engine-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; }
  .lines { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0.4rem 0 0; min-height: 4.6em; }
  .lines :global(li) { padding: 0.2rem 0.3rem; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .lines :global(li:hover) { background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 8%, transparent); }
  .lines :global(.score) { display: inline-block; min-width: 3.6rem; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .opening { min-height: 1.5em; margin: 0.6rem 0; }
  .moves { max-height: 22rem; overflow-y: auto; line-height: 1.9; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 15%, transparent); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem; min-height: 4rem; }
  .moves :global(.mv) { cursor: pointer; padding: 0.05rem 0.25rem; border-radius: 3px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .moves :global(.mv:hover) { background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 10%, transparent); }
  .moves :global(.mv.current) { background: var(--accent-fill); color: #fff; }
  .moves :global(.num) { color: var(--muted); margin-left: 0.3rem; }
  .moves :global(.var) { display: block; margin-left: 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92em; }
  .moves :global(.var .mv) { color: var(--fg); }
  .move-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .io { margin: 0.5rem 0; }
  .io textarea, .copy input { width: 100%; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .copy { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .copy input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .error { color: var(--loss); }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .small { font-size: 0.85rem; }
</style>

<script>
  import { mountAnalysis } from '../scripts/analysis';
  mountAnalysis(document.getElementById('analysis')!);
</script>
